msgid "Optional. The letters form can be shown in Spanish, Catalan, Basque, Galician, English, Portuguese, French, Italian and German. With this key, the texts configured for each retreat (custom message and legal disclaimer) are translated automatically into the language of the visitor when the retreat has no version written for that language. Each translation is done once and cached, and done again only if the original text changes. Only those retreat texts are sent to DeepL, never letters or personal data. The free plan, DeepL API Free, translates up to 500,000 characters a month."
